pass_bodies.lerta:14:1: indent by two spaces for each level, and end the lines with LF (Layout)
pass_bodies.lerta:16:11: put a body on the line of `->` if it is one statement that fits there, else below (Function bodies)
pass_bodies.lerta:19:7: put a body on the line of `->` if it is one statement that fits there, else below (Function bodies)
pass_bodies.lerta:23:14: write an arm of one statement on its line, and `else if` for an `else` of one `if` (Branches)
